8n/kr","라이스"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","哇哦，真难得，在这里能碰上懂时尚的人！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/kr","우와. 여기서 패션 감각 있는 사람을 만나다니, 드문 일이네!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415665.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415665.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 诡草"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/kr","쿠루루 & 라이스"]]}